{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL0NydWVsJTIwSW5zdHJ1Y3Rpb24lMjAlMjgyMDIyJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Cruel Instruction","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/sNhfPGpTzDQlhSLMvttth4fOtMU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7ZOmcNRhCqu4xFW0SREqBREIfQ0.jpg","description":"The story of 16-year-old Kayla Adams, whose mother, Karen is advised by the school’s counselor to send Kayla to get treatment at a youth residential treatment center after she gets expelled from school. Kayla arrives at the Utah facility on the same day as her roommate Amanda, a treatment program veteran who knows exactly what the girls were in for. Led by headmistress Miss Connie, the staff uses draconian methods including force-feeding medications, arbitrary punishments, solitary confinement, verbal and physical abuse to keep the students in line. After being pushed to their limits and stripped of their lifelines, including any ability to freely communicate with the outside world, the two young women must band together to survive and fight to expose the abuse before it’s too late.\n\nRated PG-13 · Released 12 Mar 2022 · Canada, United States of America · Language: English · 85 min\nStudio: Happier Ever After Films, Lighthouse Pictures, MarVista Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["TV Movie","Thriller","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.9","imdb_id":"tt17621226","moviedb_id":946581,"tmdbId":946581,"runtime":"85 min","cast":["Kelcey Mawema","Morgan Taylor Campbell","Camryn Manheim","Cynthia Bailey","Jason Gray-Stanford","Calder Stewart","Sydney Scotia","Genea Charpentier"],"director":["Stanley M. Brooks"],"writer":["Adrienne Rush"],"released":"2022-03-12T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Canada, United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Stanley M. Brooks","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uuYghVDUat